@startuml
' plantuml/plantuml#2834: sequence diagram rendering regression in the JS
' (TeaVM) build, sized similarly to the diagrams in the performance report
' (tens of alternating arrows). This is a pure performance/regression pin:
' the SVG output must stay byte-identical before and after the fix to
' RealMax's recursion guard and the real package's constructor stack
' captures -- only the cost of producing it should change.
!pragma teoz true
participant Alice
participant Bob
Alice -> Bob : message 0
Bob -> Alice : message 1
Alice -> Bob : message 2
Bob -> Alice : message 3
Alice -> Bob : message 4
Bob -> Alice : message 5
Alice -> Bob : message 6
Bob -> Alice : message 7
Alice -> Bob : message 8
Bob -> Alice : message 9
Alice -> Bob : message 10
Bob -> Alice : message 11
Alice -> Bob : message 12
Bob -> Alice : message 13
Alice -> Bob : message 14
Bob -> Alice : message 15
Alice -> Bob : message 16
Bob -> Alice : message 17
Alice -> Bob : message 18
Bob -> Alice : message 19
@enduml
